---
import { ArrowRight } from "lucide-react";
import { MarketingButton } from "../../../client/components/untitled/MarketingButton";
import { Button } from "../../../client/components/untitled/base/buttons/button";
---

<section class="marketing-section bg-slate-50" aria-labelledby="home-routes-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-6 lg:px-12">
    <div class="mb-8 max-w-3xl md:mb-12">
      <p class="marketing-eyebrow mb-5">Which one are you?</p>
      <h2 id="home-routes-heading" class="text-balance font-heading text-4xl font-bold text-slate-950 md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">Start with what your customers need.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="flex min-w-0 flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
        <div class="aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-100 p-4 pb-0">
          <img src="/images/case-studies/midland-oil-group/mog-new-sectors.webp" alt="Midland Oil's product choices grouped by industry" width="2537" height="1228" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="h-full w-full rounded-t-lg object-cover object-top shadow-sm" />
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 md:p-7">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-slate-950">Trade and industrial businesses</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 font-body text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Help buyers find the right product and ask for a quote.</p>
          <p class="mt-5 border-l-2 border-uui-brand-600 pl-4 font-body text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700">Midland's new site sorts its oils by the work buyers do.</p>
          <div class="mt-auto pt-5"><MarketingButton action="caseStudy" variant="link" /></div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="flex min-w-0 flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
        <div class="relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-slate-100">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560066984-138dadb4c035?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A salon interior, shown as an example" width="800" height="533" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
          <p class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 rounded-md bg-white px-2 py-1 font-body text-xs text-slate-700">Salon photo for illustration.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 md:p-7">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-slate-950">Local service businesses</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 font-body text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Make it easy to check your work and book with you.</p>
          <p class="mt-5 border-l-2 border-uui-brand-600 pl-4 font-body text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700">Helen Moore's salon pages give visitors a clear route to booking.</p>
          <div class="mt-auto pt-5"><MarketingButton action="caseStudy" href="/case-studies/helen-moore-hairdressing/" variant="link" /></div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="flex min-w-0 flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex aspect-[16/9] items-center justify-center gap-4 bg-uui-brand-50 px-5 font-body" role="img" aria-label="Midland Oil load time: more than 8 seconds before, 1.2 seconds after">
          <div aria-hidden="true" class="text-center"><p class="font-heading text-4xl text-slate-600">8s+</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">Before</p></div>
          <ArrowRight size={26} aria-hidden="true" className="shrink-0 text-uui-brand-600" />
          <div aria-hidden="true" class="text-center"><p class="font-heading text-5xl text-uui-brand-800">1.2s</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-uui-brand-800">After</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 md:p-7">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-slate-950">Slow WordPress sites</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 font-body text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Find out what is worth keeping and what needs to change.</p>
          <p class="mt-5 border-l-2 border-uui-brand-600 pl-4 font-body text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700">Midland's old site took more than 8 seconds to load. Its new site takes 1.2.</p>
          <div class="mt-auto pt-5"><Button href="/services/wordpress-web-design/" color="link-color" className="whitespace-normal text-left">Explore WordPress web design</Button></div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-8 font-body text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
      Planning your next site? Read our guide to <a href="/blog/choose-web-design-agency-liverpool/" class="underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-slate-950">choosing a web designer</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
